    "updated_at": "2021-09-30T10:24:14Z",
    "body": "> I think at least in theory a connection can encompass multiple origins (if the certificate is valid for all of them, though not all user agents support this), how does `secureConnectionStart` deal with that?\r\n\r\nIt would [clamp](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#clamp-and-coarsen-connection-timing-info) `secureConnectionStart` to `fetchStart` - it would look like the secure connection was immediate. ",
